Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your life that I\Nwant, but you're where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What a low-down, rotten trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheating bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he so scared of Lucy that\Nhe had to change the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to do something in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take down Doflamingo and\Nkiss that birdcage goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I made my message perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you bring me Straw Hat\Nor I kill you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gets, can we afford to wait on Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,People are going to die if\Nwe hold out much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that, but I can't send a\Nfighter in his condition back into the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Until he gets his Haki back,\Nhe's under my protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Trafalgar Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're running too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat gonna get his Haki back or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just he said he\Nneeded ten minutes and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,now we've got about\Nthree and a half to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take him under my care from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:03:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Every second counts. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Less than three minutes to go until the\Nwalls of the birdcage close completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, don't make me look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing in my period's gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it just like Mr. Zoro. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And push!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all terribly injured, but\Nnow they're exerting so much strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A few moments ago, some of\Nthem couldn't even stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone fight back\Nagainst something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What were those fluffy things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called dandelions.\NWhat are they? An ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Monchory creates them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're healing flowers that\Nsprout up from her tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I can't run any faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to or you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we don't want to leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I twisted my ankle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought you twisted your ankle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dandelion Puffs can heal\Npeople over a wide area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere they fall, they\Nbring miraculous recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing the sad state that her home is in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Monchery is overwhelmed with\Ngrief and overflowing with tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But her sorrow can save a\Ncountless number of lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the injured\Nfighters rose up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the ability has a drawback.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Although everyone is strong and healthy\Nright now, the effect is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,After three minutes have passed, everyone\Nwill revert to their former state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's a life support procedure designed\Nto see us through this final battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden the pain just went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can run again, that\Nmeans I don't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a miracle, it must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone up there in heaven is\Nlooking out for our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Princess Monchery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way that I can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to use any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't stop the bad\Nguys, even though I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have are these\Ntears that never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I actually think that's\Na kind and honorable way to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's injuries are healing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to what I have to say first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hack? What is it?\NNot him. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the five-star guy got us\Nup so what was your crime
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,anyway shut up now this is the\Ndeal if you're strong we need
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,your help in the east and west\Nmy friends are there pushing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the bird cage back by force\Nthis is the only way he really
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,thinks we can push back the\Nbird cage no way that's gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,happen man that's crazy yeah\Nthat's totally impossible trust
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in my friends you won't know\Nuntil you try we made a god angry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll do our best you hear\Nthat it's going to be all right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still people out there fighting\Nto save Dressrosa. Come on, you'll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,be okay thanks rebecca they're fighting\Nthe birdcage with all their might
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if it can't be stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong they are, then\Nall their efforts will be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:09:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can't fight as\Nwell as someone like Lucy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,if everyone is laying their lives on\Nthe line, I have to do whatever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Father, but there's\Nonly one way to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,By killing the flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola! Rebeca!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let you join your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never be able to face\NKiros again, as long as I lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what business do\Nyou have with me, Viola?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Don Quixote family is\Nabout to be obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do nothing to take\Nresponsibility as a former executive,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be an insult to this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one of us is going to\Nleave this battle alive, Dolphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You always were a woman of\Npassion, weren't you, Violet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a child! Let us through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holds up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They said there's danger up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody here is making any progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the kingdom\Nwas headed for downtown,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that we're here, we're stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta push way harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this little prose!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this thing, I guarantee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all given a place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a success?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:11:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's slowed down\Na little bit. Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Snipe, but I\Nbelieve you are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for you, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid you'll have\Nto tell me who's speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm blind you see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to turn my back on people in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they are a bunch of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although my strength may be meager.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall devote it to\Nyour cause all the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:12:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,assist whoever you can\Nat pushing back the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why we may survive those who can't\Nuse Haki? Head to the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's push that factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't stop! You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone runs away, how\Nwill anything get fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pushing, too. What? Wait! Now push!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out these arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Check my zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to help push!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our kingdom,\Nso we gotta protect it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mega Muscles coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to give\Nthis everything you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We might not be as strong as you\Nare, but we want to push too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get up here and push! Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting chopped up without a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it started up again,\Nwe didn't stop it. Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro showed us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for guiding us with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We stopped it once and we'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a big push. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick and Commander Tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you saved this kingdom yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for your efforts, we would have\Nlost thousands of our citizens already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep people\Nin no birdcage, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that these\Nfolks are born to be free?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are we going to prove it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We push the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing, birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola, run! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You spent ten years with\Nme as part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So surely I would hesitate for a\Nmoment at least, before I killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But you misunderstand my philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't punish my associates\Nfor their failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But betrayals are another matter entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can play, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your sweet Rebecca now, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my body—I can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing with that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look safe at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl, come this way for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle's between you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying, but it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now kill Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made it all the way to the\Nold King's Plateau. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much city left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:18:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,People are going to start\Ndying one after another soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a second could save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. I lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer until\NLucy comes back? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage was halted for a moment,\Nbut now it continues to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The time remaining is 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The time until Luffy\Nrecovers is also 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We stopped it once, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it again if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta remember what's at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you push or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not helping. Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We all got too many dreams to give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stacy, everybody, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have all seen enough suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be much longer now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of PA?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hero is on his way! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Jax, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The announcer from the Coliseum?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this is, now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole kingdom's about\Nto be destroyed, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd rather hear from King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Unpredictable in nature and\Nirrepressible in spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he burst onto the sea\Nand, more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,into our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The hero who lit up the Coliseum\Nlike a shining star! Shining star?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one answer, surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He means me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know I said I'd\Nstay here with you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it turns out my fans need me. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Trafalgar! What? Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocked my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He tamed the savage bull that struck\Nfear into the hearts of all gladiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His fearsome fists fell\Nthe giant even the living
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,legend Don Chinchao\Nfaltered before his might.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Though small in stature, his energy\Nwas felt through all of the coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, through all of Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A man who was born to be free,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,who fought perfectly, who struck\Na chord in our hearts brilliantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw him. That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He was pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He blew me away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the city\Nwas watching him fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.50,0:22:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How is a gladiator\Nsupposed to save us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.71,0:22:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But Lucy was only an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He has another name you don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Known as Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukey
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure had me fooled with that beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be wary about\Ntrusting another pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When Doflamingo has been lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And grinding us under\Nhis heel for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,However.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's different from\Nthe Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who tried to pass themselves off as our\Nsaviors that night so many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.86,0:23:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, listen to King Rick, who\Nplaced his faith in Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.18,0:23:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the call before the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy is taking a breather right\Nnow in preparation for round two,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.56,0:23:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's going to come back even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So raise your hands in\Ncelebration, Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I spoke to Lucy,\Nand he made me a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll face Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.72,0:23:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And knock him out in one punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.98,0:23:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure talks big.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making this quick, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:23:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Real fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.24,0:24:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.42,0:24:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheating our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Filling our streets with lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sitting on a misbegotten throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.04,0:24:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Build on a mountain of injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you must face your trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.08,0:24:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cruelty ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.80,0:24:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.82,0:24:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're mad, come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.76,0:24:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your filthy hands\Nup, Viola and Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the Coliseum Shining Star,\Nour Lucy, will take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.84,0:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show him how we feel\Nand give the man a cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.66,0:25:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.12,0:25:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like their injuries\Ncame back all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.74,0:25:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dropping like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because time has run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.56,0:25:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These people were the ones who\Nwere given the dandelictures first,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.88,0:25:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they're wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.36,0:25:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And they aren't going to work twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.26,0:25:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried, but my ability\Njust didn't come enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.60,0:25:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I did such an awful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:26:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them a host, and I yanked it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true, Princess Moncheree.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.86,0:26:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no telling just how many lives\Nthe birdcage might have claimed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.64,0:26:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.66,0:26:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a miracle happen down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.96,0:26:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear out the injured and have the\Npeople in the back take their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.14,0:26:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring in some fresh troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.68,0:26:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hold our ground at any cost until\NLucy gets rid of the birdcage for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.90,0:26:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They were able to stall it long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, they'll survive\Ntill Loopyland returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.86,0:26:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin the countdown\Nto Lucy's countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Call out his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.16,0:26:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure he can hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.46,0:27:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.37,0:27:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.29,0:27:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Count from three!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it! Lose it! Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.66,0:27:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.06,0:27:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose it! One!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.94,0:27:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.58,0:27:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time is up, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy's gonna knock you out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.18,0:27:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One punch and you're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, you can go quiet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.44,0:28:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Forever, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Biela! Wake up, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.94,0:28:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.42,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.58,0:28:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it's over, you can\Nstrike it from your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.06,0:28:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.40,0:28:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that you move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.94,0:28:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.80,0:28:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.24,0:28:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I have to leave you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it will hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.02,0:28:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it won't be easy to overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.92,0:28:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.54,0:29:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.28,0:29:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy is here at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.76,0:29:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy! Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.98,0:30:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Star-Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.36,0:30:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all rather dramatic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I imagine it took a\Nlot just to recover your Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's probably a struggle\Nfor you just to stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.96,0:30:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're no better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.74,0:30:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.10,0:30:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.52,0:31:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you crawled off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.20,0:31:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got front row seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.56,0:31:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch as I crush the\Nonly hope you've got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.08,0:31:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Time forever, White!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.98,0:31:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They turned the whole block into strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.66,0:31:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.44,0:31:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.20,0:31:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.78,0:31:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.28,0:31:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Flapping threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.80,0:32:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.46,0:32:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.14,0:32:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Done already.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.96,0:32:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your comeback, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.96,0:32:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing that miraculous\NHaki of yours, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.58,0:32:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't look good. Did Lucy win?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.80,0:33:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.16,0:33:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.14,0:33:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.12,0:33:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's moving on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.54,0:33:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you\Nsurvived that last assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to inhale\Nyou properly next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.34,0:33:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should force you to\Nkill all of your friends instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.48,0:33:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, came running back\Nwith your tail between your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.38,0:33:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you escaped death\Nagain. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.92,0:33:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'm gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.60,0:34:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your famous Kong gun didn't do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.44,0:34:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy was huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Way bigger than the last one,\Nso the move didn't work, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.76,0:34:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.84,0:34:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.90,0:34:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're in trouble, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.10,0:34:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, if the kong gun doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll just have to\Ncome up with something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.06,0:34:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.12,0:34:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.80,0:34:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All those little insects were so much\Nbetter off dancing on their streams,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.18,0:34:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,trapped in my cage as\Nthey were meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.80,0:34:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Insects?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.71,0:34:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.26,0:34:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.17,0:34:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are nothing but garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.14,0:34:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.24,0:35:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're waiting, Lupi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.16,0:35:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.26,0:35:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn into your stupid balloon man, Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.04,0:35:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be more fun for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.94,0:35:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you kill all your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.90,0:35:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,then kill everyone else in the\Nkingdom while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, fourth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.98,0:35:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.62,0:36:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have much strength remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.40,0:36:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you think\Nyou can last in that war?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.88,0:36:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.78,0:36:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you want to challenge\Nsomeone like me in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.90,0:36:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.40,0:36:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Still beating me in one hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.62,0:36:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.26,0:36:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I like\Nyou looking down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.92,0:36:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.00,0:36:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to drag you to the\Nground and make you my puppet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You just grab whatever\Nyou want and strangle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.88,0:36:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.20,0:37:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't control everyone either!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing you makes it hard to even breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.96,0:37:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.58,0:37:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To be born as a human is\Nto be born as living trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.54,0:37:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my divine right to\Ncontrol you as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.34,0:37:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everyone here will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.64,0:37:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be able to breathe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.24,0:37:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick my ass, then. Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.68,0:37:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight a whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.82,0:37:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Kong gun doesn't work, then you'll\Njust have to come up with something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.46,0:37:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kong-Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.44,0:37:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.66,0:37:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.78,0:37:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear is indeed strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.00,0:38:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid it taxes\Nyour body too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.34,0:38:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.46,0:38:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be even harder on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.90,0:38:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, King Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.24,0:38:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All those who won't obey me must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.82,0:38:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My sixteen holy bullets\Nshall be your trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.92,0:38:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,God Threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.64,0:38:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.50,0:39:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who fear the inheritors of\ND have given them another title,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.50,0:39:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sworn enemy of gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.14,0:39:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You
